        "Z_{i,\\{0\\}}"
      ],
      "highlight_phrases": []
    },
    {
      "paper_id": "aos-2024-v52-i06-p2913",
      "local_id": "D21",
      "local_label": "Section 3.1 — Cumulative dependence (15)",
      "source_heading": "Section 3.1 — Cumulative dependence (15)",
      "source_kind": "definition",
      "statement_original": "To measure the temporal dependence for the whole time series, we define the cumulative dependence measure of $(Z_i)_{i\\ge n}$ on $\\varepsilon_0$:\n\\[\n\\Theta_{n,\\theta}=\\sum_{i\\ge n}\\delta_{i,\\theta},\\qquad n\\ge0.\\tag{15}\n\\]",
