      "source_kind": "source_passage",
      "statement_original": "In the statement of the proof we write $a_n\\ll b_n$ or $b_n\\gg a_n$ to mean that $a_n=o(b_n)$, as $n\\to\\infty$. The quantities $d=d_n$ and $\\tau=\\tau_n$ are the ones from (4), which we allow to depend on $n$ without making this explicit in the notation, and $k$ is the user-chosen block size; cf. Section 2.3.1. Further, $m:=\\lfloor n/k\\rfloor$ and $\\eta:=\\lfloor\\tau/k\\rfloor$, as before.",
